    "title": "Lavrov declares the loss of Swiss political neutrality",
    "text": "Switzerland lost Renome of a neutral reconciliation worthy of trust. This statement was made by Russian Foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov RIA news.\nThe meeting of Lavrov and Swiss Foreign Minister Injacio Kassis was “in the fields” of the high week of the United Nations General Assembly.\nThe current separate international issues are considered, including resolving the Ukrainian conflict. On the Russian side, the loss of Renoma Switzerland deserves the belief in neutral intermediaries emphasized, the head of the department noted.\nAs a rule, the Ministers discussed OSCE in the context of the upcoming Swiss president in the organization in 2026. In particular, Lavrov talked about his assessment of “Reasons for discomfort in OSCE.”\nEarlier, it was reported that Swiss armed forces will participate in NATO exercises, which will be held in Portugal in the next few weeks. It has been clarified that the Swiss Air Force in the exercises will be represented by five F/A-18 fighters.\nAt the same time, in August, it was known that for Switzerland, sending a military army to Ukraine was excluded to force the world.",
